{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ac79d6ec540f10592fc41b18048e4bede87d9965a602b397efcbc62997ee6904","ja":"スタジオのみなさん、テレビをご覧のみなさん、\nこんにちは～♪　私たちは、お買い物に来ていま～す♪","zh":"演播室的各位，电视机前的各位观众，\n大家中午好～♪ 我们现在正出来买东西呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7bcae1f70847df80f6f03381b85546241ce171e22f81882031765104067ac3c2","ja":"今から『charming』と『sweetie』の\n2組に分かれて、対決をします～。","zh":"现在要分成“charming”和“sweetie”\n2组进行对决啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f6a080569f5f5a7d7faa0c3530e8d89a82e0508dd104a880639bf87b6523a01f","ja":"対決内容は、『お題に沿った商品を探そう！』","zh":"对决内容为“寻找符合题目的商品！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a30ccace1af3f0f8534bc6f880180d28bc4ecf2af19ecc15f72d41f750cca6b2","ja":"どちらが選んだ商品がお題にピッタリか、\nスタジオで観覧のみなさんに判定していただきます！","zh":"究竟哪边挑选的商品更符合题目，\n将由演播室里的现场观众来评判！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2019c0e73c7dddf1409c0d71d82a2c57093d19d016ec4d342b7ace8ff93fbe6b","ja":"私たちも今からお題を聞くんですけど……って、え！？\n私たちは『チャーミングなもの』？","zh":"我们现在也要听题目了……等等，诶！？\n我们要找的是“迷人的东西”？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4ef8fa70357bcfbbffde54d7ca3cbb24223a7f3bc94545628a1c0460836e3f06","ja":"まんまやないかーい！\nってことは、sweetie組は……？","zh":"根本没变嘛！\n也就是说，sweetie组会是……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"5bab62c0a2df2fb3422b07c01c93734a190b99901280b0e99915f148ec736dfe","ja":"『スウィーティーなもの』だって！　こっちも\nそのままだネ。それじゃあさっそく、スタートだヨ～♪","zh":"说是“甜甜的东西”呢！这边也是\n照字面意思呢。那么就赶快，开始喽～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d5aa6638700d9bf2890131989ca9c9aaec247bdff533eb7dfcce5083631652ef","ja":"このみん、えれなん！\nチャーミングなぬいぐるみがあったよ～♪","zh":"此美姐、艾莲娜！\n这里有只可爱的玩偶哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"704760898249b3987f3bec256025a3cab44a1c5ac999240420ae960cd9596ac3","ja":"これって……変わった顔してるネ！\nネコ？　ゾウ？　ウシ？　なんの動物なのかナ？","zh":"这个长得……好奇怪呢！\n是猫？大象？牛？到底是什么动物呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"e687c110274217be8745cca16210fc2f824df57fea90a44774f6ecb749debb38","ja":"なんだか得体がしれないわね……。","zh":"总觉得有些来历不明呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"e53802ca099f0259c486d4531ae02e60158de23ccdb495374bdc791db59f3e54","ja":"じっと見てたら、\nかわいく見えてこなくもない……のかしら？","zh":"越是盯着看，\n就越觉得好像也不是不可爱……吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"2cf0feb308d7487a6e3d82341afb1f334d4bbb61fc49366141f56e9274bafd3f","ja":"でしょでしょ？　なんともいえないビミョーな感じが\n新たなチャーミングの境地を切り開かせるのだよ！","zh":"对吧对吧？那种说不清道不明的微妙感觉，\n开辟出了迷人的全新境界哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"996cc237703a87e86951343801fb1482ff94d47eef215e907c529c7ccd9d1701","ja":"アハハ♪　よくわかんないヨ～。","zh":"啊哈哈♪　我搞不太懂啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"f2eeaa99ed1217cd39c656203dea17c956b95fcf4a367c70dce3d5e6b1b00933","ja":"そうねぇ、独創的で面白いとは思うけど、今回は\n王道なものを見つけたほうが無難じゃないかしら？","zh":"是啊，虽然我觉得挺有创意、挺有趣的，但这次\n是不是找点王道的内容更稳妥一些呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1708.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"ed384f7f3c6b3ee4eb920e7c888c189d571fdd57292e09d13c13db8da628bcb6","ja":"ええ～っ！？　そんな～！","zh":"诶诶～！？怎么这样～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
